# The spec-vector corpus is byte-compared by the parity suites
# (testManifestJSONMatchesTheCommittedBytes and friends). EOL normalization at
# checkout — e.g. core.autocrlf=true on GitHub's Windows runners — rewrites the
# committed LF bytes to CRLF on disk and breaks byte-identity, so conversion is
# forbidden for the whole corpus (JSON and CBOR alike).
spec/vectors/** -text
